        "nan-Latn-TW-x-poj": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "téng-bīn siāng chōe hián-sī 100 ê sû， nā chhōe-bô sû， chhiáⁿ iōng ē-kha ê「phah-jī chhōe sû」 kong-lêng chhiau-chhōe。"
